    "Katalog definisi metric BERVERSEI — bukan rekomendasi strategi, bukan daftar path.",
    "Registry-backed metric = satu-satunya jalur metric sah di rilis pertama (ADR-GR1 di implementation-log);",
    "metric di luar registry → GOAL_METRIC_UNSUPPORTED (abstain aman + alasan), TIDAK dipetakan ke slot revenue terdekat.",
    "Semantics (enum tertutup): INCREASE_TO_THRESHOLD | DECREASE_TO_THRESHOLD | MAINTAIN_RANGE | AT_LEAST | AT_MOST | COUNT_IN_WINDOW | RATE_OR_RATIO | EVIDENCE_CRITERIA.",
    "Role (enum tertutup): outcome | leading_indicator | enabler | guardrail | diagnostic | activity.",
    "Validator: ontology/registry/validate_metrics.py (make gate-fast)."
